{
 "id": "lem-trf-flat-tensor-preserves-injection",
 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Tensoring with a flat module preserves injective maps",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a commutative semiring [def-weil-size-convention], let $M,N,P$ be $R$-modules, and let $f:N\\to P$ be an injective $R$-linear map. If $M$ is flat over $R$, then the induced map $M\\otimes_RN\\to M\\otimes_RP$ is injective.",
